# Output that maquettiste generate writes into a copy of this fixture (tools/gate3.sh, the pack tests): the built roots, the
# committed roots db/ and docs/ (the process-docs pages, regenerated from the model) and the endpoint files with their regions
# (regenerated from the model, nothing hand-written in them here), the manifests and the run cache. Custom/ holds the committed
# companions and stays tracked.
/db/
/docs/
/src/Processes.Data/Generated/
/src/Processes.Data/Custom/Processes/*/Endpoints/
/src/Processes.Tests/Generated/
/.maquettiste/.cache/
/.maquettiste/manifest/
/.maquettiste/snapshots/
